'''Mia Gabon''' was a [[human]] [[New Republic pilot|pilot]] who served the [[New Republic]] in the [[New Republic Defense Fleet Starfighter Corps|Starfighter Corps]] of the [[New Republic Defense Force]] during the [[Cold War]] with the [[First Order]]. In [[34 ABY]], Gabon flew a [[T-85 X-wing starfighter]] as part of a [[Kazuda Xiono's team|team]] alongside fellow [[pilot]]s [[Kazuda Xiono]] and [[Hugh Sion]] on a [[Mission to rendezvous with the Resistance|mission]] to deliver intelligence to [[Commander]] [[Poe Dameron]]. While being pursued by [[Major]] [[Elrik Vonreg]] of the First Order, Xiono ordered Gabon and Sion to jump to [[hyperspace]] while he stayed behind to finish the mission.

==Biography==
{{Quote|We can't even touch him!"<br />"Fine, I'll deliver the intel. You guys report back to base. That's an order!''"<br />"''Promise you'll be right behind us.|Mia Gabon and Kazuda Xiono|audio=RightBehindUs-TheRecruit.flac|<ref name="The Recruit" />}}
[[File:XionosSquadron-TheRecruitPart1.png|thumb|left|300px|Gabon and their teammates under pursuit by Vonreg]]
In [[34 ABY]],<ref name="Timelines">{{ResistanceDate|1|1}}</ref> during the [[Cold War]] between the [[New Republic]] and its allies and the [[First Order]], the [[human]] Mia Gabon served in the [[New Republic Defense Force]]'s [[New Republic Defense Fleet Starfighter Corps|Starfighter Corps]] as the [[New Republic pilot|pilot]] of a [[T-85 X-wing starfighter]] and member of a [[Kazuda Xiono's team|team]] under the command of fellow [[pilot]] [[Kazuda Xiono]]. Along with Xiono and another pilot, [[Hugh Sion]], they were sent on a [[Mission to rendezvous with the Resistance|mission]] to rendezvous with [[Commander]] [[Poe Dameron]] of the [[Resistance]] to deliver intelligence.<ref name="The Recruit" />

After arriving at the rendezvous point, the three pilots were [[Starfighter combat|ambushed]] by<ref name="The Recruit" /> [[Major]] [[Elrik Vonreg]]<ref name="Vonreg DB">{{Databank|major-vonreg|Major Vonreg}}</ref> of the First Order, and Gabon and Sion were concerned that they would be unable to complete their mission. Xiono ordered them and Sion to escape into [[hyperspace]] and return to base as he covered them. After Gabon and Sion closed their [[S-foils]] and made their hyperspace jumps, Xiono's [[starfighter]] was shot by Vonreg, though the pilot was soon rescued by Commander Dameron. Instead of returning to base to rendezvous with Gabon and Sion, however, Xiono volunteered to join the Resistance,<ref name="The Recruit" /> with his lack of returning causing Sion and Gabon to assume the worst.<ref name="Rebuilding">{{Resistance|Rebuilding the Resistance}}</ref>

==Personality and traits==
Gabon had [[Color|brown]] [[hair]] and [[eye]]s and light skin. When under pursuit by Vonreg, they showed distress and frustration due to their inability to land a shot on their enemy. When given the order to return to base, Gabon complied while asking Xiono to promise he would be right behind them.<ref name="The Recruit" /> After Xiono failed to return to base, Gabon feared the worst.<ref name="Rebuilding" />

==Equipment==
While flying their T-85 X-wing starfighter, Gabon wore a blue New Republic [[flight suit]] that included a blue [[flight helmet]] with two red, rounded triangles on either side of its center white stripe, with a red line beside each of the triangles. The helmet also had a breathing tube attached to the left side of the chin.<ref name="The Recruit" />

==Behind the scenes==
{{Quote|Hey!! Be sure to check me out as 'Mia Gabon' in the premiere of Star Wars: Resistance tonight on Disney Channel!|Cherami Leigh announcing her role as Mia Gabon|<ref name="Instagram">{{Instagram|username=clkstar|url=p/BopdzSBH6tZ|name=Cherami Leigh|archiveurl=https://archive.ph/mJjuN}}</ref>}}
Mia Gabon first appeared in the first part of the ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'' animated television series' two-part [[Star Wars Resistance Season One|season one]] premiere, "[[The Recruit]]," where they were voiced by [[Cherami Leigh]],<ref name="The Recruit" /> who was honored and excited to be involved with the show.<ref name="Instagram" /> The episode aired on [[October 7]], [[2018]].<ref name="Air date">{{DisneyPress|wdtv=1|url=disneychannel/shows/star-wars-resistance/episodes|text=Star Wars Resistance}}</ref>

